 "applies_to": "TECO-Westinghouse A510 inverters using the built-in RS-485 port (CN6), per communication addendum DOCUMENT-TECO-A510-AC001 Ver01 (2015-04).",
 "summary": "The A510 is TECO-Westinghouse's general-purpose vector inverter with a built-in RS-485 port speaking Modbus RTU or ASCII. Commands, frequency, torque and speed limit are written to 2501H-2504H; status, fault and warning codes and monitors are read from 2520H-252FH. Each parameter nn-mm has its own register, with the group in the high byte and the number in the low byte.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU",
  "ASCII"
 ],
