  "enable": "Set node address and communication settings at the keypad and select communication as run and frequency source (parameter numbers are in the A510 manual). Bit 15 of 2501H with 2503H gives torque control by communication.",
  "watchdog": null,
  "quirks": [
   "Registers are hex.",
   "Functions 03H, 06H, 08H and 10H; maximum frame 80 bytes.",
   "Node addresses 01H-FEH; 00H is broadcast.",
   "Exception 04 means more than 32 registers were requested."
  ],
  "setup": [
   "RS-485 on CN6: S+ / S- per the CN6 pin-out.",
   "The addendum shows 120 ohm terminators on p. 1-1 but says 220 ohm in Appendix A; up to 31 inverters."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Exception codes: 01 function, 02 register number, 03 data setting, 04 more than 32 registers.",
   "Inverter response time is about 10 ms."
  ]
 },
